  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "不動產估價實務專論",
    "sub_ename": "THE SPECIAL TOPIC OF REAL ESTATE APPRAISAL",
    "describe_ch": "經由理論、原則、方法之介紹，結合不動產估價相關法規及實例，瞭解不動產估價實務，並幫助學習者參加不動產估價師證照考試，希望學習者能體會如何估價，進而能掌握合理不動產市場價格。",
    "describe_eh": "To discuss the practical aspects of real estate valuation, through the case study of theory, principles and methods, combined with the use of real estate valuation acts. Understand how to evaluate , and thus to grasp the reasonable real estate market prices.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
